{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18106090","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18106090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1810609001:0":{"text":"분수도 모르는 놈. 감히 나를 막아?","source_cn":"不知好歹的家伙，你竟然敢拦我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB819617232F0EB8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810609002:1":{"text":"죄송합니다, 로저 님. 귀족의 예법을 모르는 그레이브본은 무도회에 참석할 수 없다는 영주님의 명령입니다.","source_cn":"非常抱歉，罗杰先生。领主阁下有令，禁止不懂贵族礼仪的亡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C3BD1F237EAED3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810609003:1":{"text":"그게 나와 무슨 상관이지? 내가 노바리스에서 산 게 거의 800년이야. 진작에 귀족이 된 내가 예법을 모를 리가!","source_cn":"那和我有关什么关系？我在诺珐斯生活了快八百年，早就是贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF69C1512BC90225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810609004:1":{"text":"...영주님께서는 지난 무도회에서 로저 님이 샤모나 양을 희롱하신 일을 아직 기억하고 계십니다만.","source_cn":"……上次舞会，您调戏莎梦娜小姐的事，领主阁下还没忘呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8519F3FF9DAA1810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810609005:1":{"text":"그래서 이번에는 <style=\"highlight\">귀족의 예법을 완전히 익히지 않는 한, 절대 들여보내지 말라</style>고 특별히 당부하셨습니다.","source_cn":"这次领主阁下特意嘱咐，<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B189F0767EBECFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810609006:1":{"text":"샤모나 양께서 로저 님을 용서하시기 전까지, 영주님께서는 그 어떤 해명도 듣지 않으실 겁니다. 이만 돌아가 주십시오.","source_cn":"莎梦娜小姐原谅您之前，领主阁下不会听您解释的。请离开吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x677637BC7DC0A73A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:鬼影贵族罗杰":{"text":"유령 귀족 로저","source":"鬼影贵族罗杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:鬼影男仆":{"text":"유령 하인","source":"鬼影男仆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}